00:00:03.110 --> 00:00:04.950 align:start position:0%
so far 2022 has been a great year for  games this means you've probably had  some awesome experiences but you  probably also have a handful of new  additions to your backlog not to worry  though because even though april has  some great games as well it's a little  slower than january through march so  here are all the big games that you can  look forward to playing in the month of  april and spoiler alert switch owners  are getting a lot  lego star wars games are nothing new but  until now none have attempted to pack in  the entire nine movies of the skywalker  saga originally slated for release in  spring 2021 lego star wars the skywalker  saga is a whole new game and not merely  just a collection of the previous lego  star wars games all of the missions will  be fresh for returning players and  you'll be able to start from any point  in the saga so if you really hate the  prequels even in game form then feel  free to ignore them entirely the game  also features nearly 500 characters from  the star wars universe and many of them  are playable by far my favorite new  additions to the series are character  skill trees cover based shooting  mechanics and a melee combo system lego  star wars the skywalker saga is coming  to a galaxy far far away on all consoles  and pc on april 5th  it was a little weird last year to see a  playstation studios logo pop up on an  xbox game it was even weirder when the  game was a day 1 release on game pass  and now the weirdness can continue when  that logo splashes up on a nintendo  switch screen mlb the show 2022 will  feature full cross play for all consoles  involved as well as cross progression  support that means you'll be able to  play your game pass copy and then take  it on the go via the switch and be able  to pick up in your season right where  you left off this save progression will  be done using an mlb the show account  which shouldn't be a pain to set up mlb  the show 2022 will be sliding into home  plate aka every console on april 5th  this upcoming switch title is a remaster  of the 1999 rpg chrono cross complete  with several quality of life changes  such as the ability to skip battles and  a newly refined high quality soundtrack  in addition to chrono cross the game  also includes radical dreamers a  text-based adventure game that served as  a supplemental title to chrono trigger  and was originally released on the super  famicom other new features include 3d  models converted to hd refined character  illustrations battle enhancements to  make combat easier and resolution  changes among other things chrono cross  the radical dreamers edition will  release on playstation 4 xbox one switch  and pc on april 7th  appropriately titled the house of the  dead remake this game is being published  by forever entertainment and promises to  be true to the original gameplay however  the game does offer a second mode for  fans that want to switch things up no  pun intended this mode is called horde  and is considered a fast-paced  modernized mode with up to 50 times more  monsters and unlockable rewards to  collect and similar to many other games  on nintendo's hybrid console house of  the dead will be playable using the  joy-con analog sticks or using gyroscope  functionality the house of the dead  franchise began its life as a light gun  series in arcades before later coming to  other platforms including dreamcast its  last main release was house of the dead  scarlet dawn in 2018 which was never  released outside of arcades and there  have also been spin-offs such as the  typing of the dead the house of the dead  remake comes back to life on april 7th  for nintendo switch  originally released for ps4 in 2019 for  japan and 2020 for us 13 sentinels is  now making its way onto nintendo switch  the game can be described as a  side-scrolling adventure game with  real-time strategy battles in our review  for the game heidi kemps called it a  unique genre mixing experiment that  takes elements of point-and-click  adventure games visual novels real-time  strategy games and tower defense games  to create an experience that's quite  unlike anything else out there another  way to help describe 13 sentinels is how  its gameplay is split into three  sections remembrance that focuses on  exploration and dialogue destruction  where the rts battles take place and  analysis a glossary of important info  about characters and items in the game  one thing's for sure you won't have to  worry about a lack of content here 13  sentinels drops on april 12th for  nintendo switch  just when you thought one star wars game  in april was enough 2008 star wars the  force unleashed returns to a nintendo  console in this wii port of the game  you'll play as darth vader's apprentice  starkiller and do everything in your  power to serve him on a quest to destroy  the jedi similar to the wii this version  of the game uses motion controls to help  the character feel more at one with the  force and features a dual mode so you  can hand a joy-con to a friend and then  destroy them in a 1v1 battle the  re-release of the force unleashed will  be unleashed on april 20th  motogp is back for 2022 with motogp 2022  and with it comes a handful of new  features to make it more exciting for  fans and newcomers for example moto gp  features a revised tutorial with custom  rules to help new players better  understand the game's basic mechanics  and once you're done with that the game  also offers a new moto gp academy to  help players improve their riding these  new steps towards more approachability  goes even farther when you factor in the  game's new adaptive difficulty system  moto gp 2020 is racing to a console or  pc near you on april 21st  when i read that the serpent rogue is an  action adventure game set in a medieval  fantasy world i was instantly drawn to  it and when i discovered the player is  tasked with saving the lands from an  ominous danger i knew i had to try the  demo on steam in the serpent rogue  you'll craft and brew your way to  becoming a master of alchemy all while  exploring a mythical land and fighting  all types of monsters the serpent rogue  is mixing up some potions on april 26th  for playstation 5 xbox series x and s  switch and pc  during the february 2022 direct nintendo  revealed switch sports a follow-up to  wii sports if you have fond memories of  the originals tennis and bowling games  then you're going to be very happy with  nintendo switch sports like its  predecessor switch sports delivers a  bunch of different sports to play all of  which are played with motion controls  six games will be included initially and  unlike the original wii sports nintendo  switch sports will feature online play  so you can compete against friends and  random challenges a golf game will be  added as a free update i managed to jump  into one of the network test sessions  last month and all i can say is that i  crushed everyone i went up against so if  you see me online when the full game  drops i'd suggest you leave that lobby  nintendo switch sports will bring out  everyone's competitive side on april  29th  there you have it a list of april's  biggest games somewhat dominated by  switch releases some other games that  didn't make this list include the  console version of road 96 on april 14th  and zombie army 4 also coming to switch  on april 26th so what game are you most  excited for let us know in the comments  below and while you're there let us know  what game you'd love to see announced in  april thanks for watching  [Music]  you
 

